    "Details": "This variant replaces the Balac's ATM launchers with four Clan iATM-3s and its ER Medium Laser with a Light TAG, and pairs Vehicle Stealth Armor with a Clan Nova CEWS. The ammunition had to be reduced to make room for extra heat sinks.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: This unit can not deploy in Lunar biomes.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 11/17 hexes / 330/510 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Vehicle Stealth Armor\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>        55     15\n<b>Left</b>          55     15\n<b>Right</b>        55     15\n<b>Rear</b>         50     15\n\n<b>Total</b>      230     75</color>",
